Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:07.84,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:13.54,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:25.64,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:01:00.76,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:12.52,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:56.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,W-What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.23,0:01:58.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, who's in that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:02.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:20.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What? It stopped...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.69,0:03:03.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Hey, what's going on?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:10.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is what you wanted... Kago?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.91,0:03:22.36,Default,,550,0,550,,{\b1\i1}Proof of \N Recklessness{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:27.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For now, we don't see any\Ndifferences between each of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:30.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That means you lack uniqueness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:31.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Uniqueness?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.51,0:03:36.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I would rather you say that every\NTachikoma has the same specs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:40.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But that wouldn't be exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.31,0:03:43.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll give you a little treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.81,0:03:45.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Natural oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:47.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, are you sure you want to give it that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:49.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It might learn strange things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:50.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:55.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is love for my machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:59.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Whoa! This is way different\Nfrom the usual synthetic oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.33,0:03:59.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:01.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:04.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get 6 Tachikomas ready, with full armour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:06.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:11.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,36 minutes ago at Kenbishi\NHeavy Industry's Manoeuvres Dome,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:13.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,their new multi-legged tank\Nbegan to go out of control...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:17.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We know that the guy on board is using the\Nidentification code from this machine's designer,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:20.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Takeshi Kago, who died a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:22.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But no other details for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.67,0:04:25.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No claim of responsibility or demands so far, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:29.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,bearing in mind the situation at\NHarima Education Institution Lab-City.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.57,0:04:31.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Department of Interior suggested\Nthe possibility of a terrorist attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:35.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so they requested us,\NPublic Safety Section 9, to deploy and stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:41.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We've been informed that the tank\Nwent wild during the final tune-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:46.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If the problem was a flaw in the\Nsecurity system hardware or software...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:52.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Ground SDF, who was considering officially adopting\Nthe tank, really just wants to pin all the blame on Kenbishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:53.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They never change...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:58.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They'll only help us if this is\Ndeclared to be a terrorist act.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.37,0:05:01.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Trying to look good won't help national defence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:05.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,By the way, you're going to fight against a tank\Nyou don't know the specs of, using Tachikomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:08.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're not altogether useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:09.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Way to go Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:11.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:16.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Major! The tank has changed direction, and is\Nleaving the Harima Education Institution Lab-City.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.93,0:05:18.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.53,0:05:21.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Techno-Line, stretching from the academy city,\Nis an exclusive road cut through the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:23.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it was created from a mountain trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:25.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are only farms and villages around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:29.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay, we're going to finish off the\Ntank while it's on Technology Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:35.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pazu, check if any terrorist organisations that oppose cyberbrain\Nor cyborg technology have issued a claim of responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:40.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bouma and Saitou, go ahead and set up\Nan ambush on Harima Techno-Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:43.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Snipe it from where we won't do any\Ndamage to the area, and stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:49.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, you will meet up with the Chief at Kenbishi\Nand investigate why the tank went out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:52.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou and I will lure the rampaging\Ntank with the 6 Tachikomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:55.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is your task.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:57.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't cry when you get\Nblown up by that tank, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:05.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Harima Education Institution Lab-City,\Nis where our neuro-chips were made, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:06.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A triumphant return home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:08.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop chit-chatting, or the Major will scold you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:46.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We are the Mobile Armoured Riot Police!\NExplain the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.41,0:06:47.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Give me a status report!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:48.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:52.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,According to our reports,\Nthe tank will appear soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:53.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:05.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So far, it has only destroyed its fellow\Ntanks, and hasn't attacked anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.91,0:07:08.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Open the road and leave everything to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:28.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't gawk at it too much and\Nget into its field of vision!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.92,0:07:36.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's the first time I've seen Section 9...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:43.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They really do exist...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:51.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will maintain this distance and continue\Nto keep watch until the ambush point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:55.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Jigabachi, is the army just\Ngoing look on with folded arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:07:58.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's just insurance and containment\Nfor Kenbishi Heavy Industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.82,0:08:00.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Anyway, what the heck does this tank want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.02,0:08:02.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We don't even know where it's headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:04.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is there really someone inside that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.32,0:08:08.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Even if we don't have a chance against it,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:11.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}being ignored like this really makes me mad!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:13.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Would you like to jump in front of it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:14.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Just kidding...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:17.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}I'll wait for the report from Oyaji and Togusa.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:17.24,Default,,0,1200,850,,{\b1\i1}Note: Batou calls Aramaki "Oyaji", meaning Old Man{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.34,0:08:21.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major! I looked through 20 of the 23\Norganisations which fit the search criteria,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:24.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but none of them have issued a claim of responsibility for this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:28.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Okay, then look through the remaining 3,\Nand if you can't dig out any information,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:30.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,search them in a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:35.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about we just write this off as a yukai-han,\Na tank thief, or an AI malfunction?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:35.64,Default,,0,1200,850,,Note: A Yukai-han\N delights in the reactions \N to his crimes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:39.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even the actions of a Yukai-Han or a\Ntank thief are considered terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.34,0:08:41.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We can't dismiss that fact that there\Nmight be a fault in AI completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:44.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}but we will wait for the\Nreport from the chief for that.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:53.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is a technician named Ooba who also\Nworked on the development of the tank,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:57.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,a colleague of the late Kago Takeshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:09:00.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I hear he was working on maintenance of the\Ntank until right before the situation occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:03.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You guys find out everything he\Nknows about what the tanks wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:06.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will be meeting with the heads of Kenbishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:08.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:16.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're Toshio Ooba,\Nthe development manager for the tank, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:19.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,W-what, y-yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:27.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In order to minimise the damage...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:33.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We want you to hand over your\Ninformation on the new tank immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:45.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is all of it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:46.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Y-yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:50.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Major! I'll send you the data on the tank,\Nthat Kenbishi Heavy Industry gave us.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:53.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:54.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll be able to get something out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:58.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So in the end, all we did was stare at this clunky tank's ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:10:00.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're almost at the ambush point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:02.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Saitou! Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:06.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Almost...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:08.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:09.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:25.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stand back Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.55,0:10:28.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Not yet! I'll wait until the last\Nsecond, so we don't alert it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:32.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Satellite link established.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.75,0:10:34.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:36.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:50.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:54.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, the data from the\N"Hawk's Eye" has been stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:56.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He seems to be linked with the satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:57.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Give me one more chance with my naked eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:10.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems, you didn't give us all\Nof the information on the tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.21,0:11:15.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Withdraw and meet up with us!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:15.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:20.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is he going to take the highway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:22.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He probably has somewhere he wants to go quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.19,0:11:42.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Jigabachi's leaving...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.89,0:11:45.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's almost time for the news\Ncensorship to be broken...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:48.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No sign of any terrorist organisations...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.19,0:11:52.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So unless Kenbishi admits\Nthat this is their fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:54.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The army will pretend to know nothing about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.59,0:11:56.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I guess we'll have to stop this ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:11:58.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's put our hopes in the Ape-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:01.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like we can't take it easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:04.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's going to be a totally different story,\Ndepending on which way he goes at the fork.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:09.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You must have known the answer the Army\Nwould give us, without even asking them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:13.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The rest is up to whether or not you can trust\Nus, Public Safety Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:19.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We spent 6 years developing the H-A-W-206!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.36,0:12:24.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You cops can't guarantee we won't\Nbe damaged by revealing the specs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.66,0:12:27.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's assuming someone will purchase it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:30.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At this rate, that promotional vehicle\Nbearing the Kenbishi logo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:34.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,will be showing a demonstration of the worst kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:35.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:41.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you please stop the tank with your tanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:50.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:56.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why will you not tell me?\NYou made that tank, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:12:59.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why do you think it went out of control?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:00.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you really not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:06.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're not really questioning you as a suspect...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Will you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:14.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Or, do you have a reason that you can't tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:18.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Batou! We're going to verify\Nwhich way it wants to go.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:20.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Isn't it going to the city?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:21.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Don't get shot!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:29.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Scatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.73,0:13:35.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:38.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.23,0:13:39.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait there for rescue, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:40.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:44.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's lucky, he broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.73,0:13:46.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He might get a structural analysis!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.47,0:13:59.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Chief! He's headed for the bridge!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:01.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}It might be our last chance\Nto use the anti-tank missile!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:04.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Ask them if the missile will be of any use.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:10.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we fail, we might destroy the bridge, which would\Ncost the taxpayers 4 times as much as SPring-8 did!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:10.09,Default,,0,0,850,,{\b1\i1}Spring-8 is the worlds most powerful synchotron, \N it cost roughly $1bn to build{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.52,0:14:12.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:14.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you think, Development Manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:25.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}When it gets to the other side of the\Nbank, it will enter the city.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:28.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Once it gets there,\Nwe'll have fewer ways of stopping it!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}You shouldn't use the missile.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:38.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Since we think it is using Mode L,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:41.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}most wireless guided missiles would be jammed.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:42.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Even a laser guided missile?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:47.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}For laser guidance, the tank will give out\Ndeceptive signals to make the missile miss.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:50.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Even with wire guidance,\Nif fired from more than 300 metres away,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.81,0:14:53.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}the tank will hack it more than 90% of the time,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:56.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}and possibly send the missile\Nback at the sniper himself.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.51,0:15:01.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you had held your tongue,\Nthat might have been good advertisement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.73,0:15:05.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, we know who's in the tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:08.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who's driving that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:10.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Takeshi Kago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:12.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you say Takeshi Kago?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.13,0:15:14.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He died a week ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:17.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.63,0:15:22.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,According to him,\Nhe connected Kago's brain to the tank's AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:23.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How could you do such a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.73,0:15:28.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well... Because it was Kago's will...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:30.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major? Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:33.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The tank's destination is Takeshi Kago's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:35.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Here's the destination...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.63,0:15:36.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's close...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.23,0:15:39.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, we're in deep trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:42.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We think his objective is to\Ntake revenge on his parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:47.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kago displayed a genius for designing tanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.93,0:15:50.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and was recruited when he was still in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:51.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His body was very weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:55.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and he was told by the doctors\Nthat unless he became a cyborg,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.65,0:15:58.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,he wouldn't be able to make\Nit to his twentieth birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:16:03.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}However, because of his religion,\Nhe wasn't allowed to even use a cyberbrain.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:09.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}He lived to be 28 because of his\Ndeep devotion to designing tanks.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:15.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Ooba, grew up in similar circumstances,\Nbut survived by becoming a cyborg.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.77,0:16:20.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}So Ooba executed Kago's will, which was that when his\Nbody died, he would be released from his religion.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.07,0:16:26.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}So, when that happened,\Nhe wanted his brain to be connected to the tank.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:28.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:29.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get me Ishizuka at the Awaji precinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.77,0:16:33.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, why does Kago want to\Ntake revenge on his parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:38.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Before Kago died,\Nhe blamed his parents for his weak body.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:41.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Whenever something happened,\Nhe always said he wanted a steel body.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:45.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}So when he was released from his\Nlife, he would be able to get a{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:47.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}steel body without going against\Nthe teachings of his parents.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:52.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Kago entrusted his dream to Ooba...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.33,0:17:34.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My my, what a stubborn guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:36.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It looks like the destination is around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.73,0:17:38.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Anyway, let's keep after it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:40.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wanna try a suicide run!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:44.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The tank has finally entered the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:47.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are no casualties so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.87,0:17:51.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, we can't be sure from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:55.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There will be no casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:02.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,P-President?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:05.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I need to leave Kenbishi\Nintact for future generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.59,0:18:08.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:14.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're going to use the wires!\NAim for the tank's legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:16.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:42.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Cut the wires!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Physical attacks are useless against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.92,0:18:52.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.72,0:18:55.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's an army's tank,\Nyou're going to get your brain toasted!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:57.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Besides, you can't even connect to it via wire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:18:59.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll do what I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:04.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How long until we're within shooting range?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.48,0:19:05.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,About two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:20.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:38.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major! No more! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.14,0:19:51.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.74,0:20:04.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.44,0:20:07.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The monkey finally persuaded the raccoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.44,0:20:07.24,Default,,0,1200,850,,{\i1}Note: He means that Aramaki \N persuaded Kenbishi's President{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:12.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kenbishi's Anti-Multi-Legged Tank weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:14.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If they had that,\Nthey should have given it to us earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:29.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It finally stopped...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.93,0:20:32.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What an adhesive...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:41.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief! Give me the passcode\Nto unlock the attack barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:44.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll open the hatch and take out Kago's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:59.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If he didn't have the defence barrier of a\Ntank, it would be just a defenseless brain...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:11.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou! Give me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:12.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:15.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Any physical traps?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:19.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think it's okay, but be careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.24,0:21:20.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Takeshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.04,0:21:24.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that you, Takeshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:31.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What the heck?! Why aren't they somewhere safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.56,0:22:04.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.76,0:22:13.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They burned Kago's brain just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.25,0:22:18.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kago...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:25.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shit, did he hate his parents that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.76,0:22:26.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nah...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:27.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:31.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When I fried Kago's brain,\Nfor just a moment, I felt his thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:36.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"How do you like it, Mother?\NMy new steel body."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:42.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A weird feeling between pride... and revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.76,0:22:45.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.86,0:22:47.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was probably an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.46,0:22:50.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I hope so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.13,0:22:56.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We don't have any way to confirm that now...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.15,0:23:18.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.65,0:23:23.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.63,0:23:27.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:34.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:39.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.43,0:23:42.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:47.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But when you live in flower just a mountain bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.85,0:23:50.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.84,0:23:54.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:23:59.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.14,0:24:00.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't sat
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.84,0:24:03.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:05.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:07.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:10.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.12,0:24:14.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.43,0:24:35.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Androids committing mass suicide together,\Nsurely a major scoop for the mass media.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.23,0:24:37.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Crimes committed by average citizens...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.73,0:24:42.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you believe in the existence of souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.33,0:24:45.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The "Laughing Man" case...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.53,0:24:49.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To tell you the truth, this case will be annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:51.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Interceptor"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.43,0:24:55.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A new version of an undetectable machine...\Nand audio-visual perception device...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.53,0:24:57.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now we have all of the pieces of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.83,0:25:00.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Want to try some feint manoeuvres?
